xxx
xxx
xxx   the following is derived from lll shock data tapes.
xxx           edited by j.c.maxwell, lanl c-3,
xxx              for stan lyon, lanl t-4.
xxx             last revised 1981 nov. 16
xxx
xxx  for each material, the data are as follows:
xxx      card 1   column 10 = 0, no fit requested for handbook
xxx                         = 1, linear fit requested
xxx      card 2   material name including formatting characters
xxx      card 3   material name continued, or blank
xxx      card 4   cols. 1-6 longitudinal velocity (f6.2)
xxx               cols. 7-12 shear velocity (f6.2)
xxx               blank if no velocities given
xxx      card 5   references (14i5) or blank
xxx      card 6 and following are data cards
xxx               cols.  1-14 description
xxx               cols. 17-18 experimental method (i2)
xxx               cols. 20-29  rho0  (e10.3)
xxx               cols. 30-39 not used in this handbook
xxx               cols. 40-45 us (f6.3)
xxx               cols. 46-51 up (f6.3)
xxx               cols. 52-72 not used in this handbook
xxx      end-of-data card      99   in cols. 15-16
xxx      end-of-all-data card  9999 in cols. 15-18
xxx
